    "spph_d5_t": "Explore Merzouga Area - Khamlia - Nomad Families - Camel Trekking - Desert Camp",
    "spph_d5": "After breakfast, we start exploring the Merzouga area. The visit can include Khamlia village, known for its Gnawa music, and nearby desert areas with black volcanic landscapes around the dunes. You may also visit nomad families living around the desert region and learn more about their traditional way of life. The route continues through small desert villages, palm areas, and viewpoints around Erg Chebbi. In the afternoon, you will prepare for the camel trek. You will ride camels across the golden dunes and enjoy the sunset over the Sahara, one of the best moments for desert photography. After the camel trek, you will reach the desert camp. Dinner will be served at the camp, followed by a peaceful night under the stars. Overnight stay will be in a desert tent.",
