    "spph_d6_t": "Merzouga Desert - Rissani - Todra Gorges - Dades Valley",
    "spph_d6": "Wake up early to enjoy the sunrise over the dunes before breakfast at the camp. This is one of the most beautiful moments of the tour, with soft light over the Sahara landscape. After breakfast, we leave Merzouga and drive towards Rissani, a historic town known for its traditional market and old caravan history. After the visit, we continue through Erfoud and desert landscapes towards Todra Gorges. Todra Gorges are among the most impressive natural sites in southern Morocco, with high rocky cliffs and narrow canyon views. You will have time to walk through the gorge and enjoy the scenery. After visiting Todra Gorges, the journey continues through Tinghir and the valley road towards Dades Valley. Along the way, you will see palm groves, kasbahs, rock formations, and mountain views. Dinner and overnight stay will be at a hotel or riad in Dades Valley.",
