    "sphm_dur2": "5 Days / 4 Nights",
    "sphm_o1": "The Morocco Honeymoon Desert Tour From Marrakech is a romantic private journey designed for couples who want to discover Morocco’s desert landscapes, old kasbahs, valleys, mountain roads, and peaceful Sahara atmosphere. This tour combines comfort, privacy, scenic routes, camel trekking, desert camp experience, and beautiful places between Marrakech and Merzouga.",
    "sphm_o2": "Your journey starts in Marrakech and crosses the High Atlas Mountains through the Tizi n’Tichka pass. Along the way, you will pass Berber villages, mountain landscapes, and the famous Ait Ben Haddou Kasbah before reaching Ouarzazate and the valleys of southern Morocco.",
