    "sphm_o4": "This honeymoon desert tour gives couples time to enjoy quiet landscapes, private moments, traditional Moroccan hospitality, and the beauty of the Sahara. The return journey passes through Rissani, Alnif, the Draa Valley, Ouarzazate, and the High Atlas Mountains before returning to Marrakech.",
    "sphm_o5": "The Morocco Honeymoon Desert Tour From Marrakech is ideal for couples looking for a private Morocco desert experience with romantic scenery, desert camp atmosphere, and a comfortable route through southern Morocco.",
