    "sphm_d1": "Your Morocco Honeymoon Desert Tour From Marrakech starts in the morning with pick-up from your accommodation in Marrakech. We leave the city and drive towards the High Atlas Mountains, crossing the Tizi n’Tichka pass with several stops for panoramic views and photos. Along the way, you will pass traditional Berber villages and mountain landscapes before reaching Ait Ben Haddou Kasbah. This ancient fortified village is one of Morocco’s most famous kasbahs and is known for its traditional earthen architecture. After visiting Ait Ben Haddou, we continue to Ouarzazate, often called the gateway to the desert. The journey continues through Skoura and the Rose Valley before reaching Dades Valley. Dinner and overnight stay will be at a hotel or riad in Dades Valley.",
