    "sgo_h1d": "The UNESCO-listed earthen ksar seen in Gladiator, Lawrence of Arabia and Game of Thrones, with narrow lanes climbing to a granary at the top.",
    "sgo_h2t": "Kasbahs and film studios",
    "sgo_h2d": "The Taourirt kasbah, once home to the Glaoui family, and the Atlas Film Studios on the edge of the city.",
    "sgo_h3t": "Dades, Todra and the Draa",
    "sgo_h3d": "Red cliffs and rock formations in the gorges, or the long palm groves and kasbahs of the Draa Valley on the southern road.",
    "sgo_h4t": "The Erg Chebbi dunes",
    "sgo_h4d": "A camel ride at sunset, dinner and Gnawa music by the fire, and a night under a sky full of stars.",
