    "sge_h1t": "The Ziz Valley",
    "sge_h1d": "Just outside Errachidia, a long green ribbon of date palms and earthen ksour cuts through the stony desert — a beautiful first view of the south.",
    "sge_h2t": "Erfoud and Rissani",
    "sge_h2d": "Erfoud is known for its fossils, and Rissani for its old market and its place on the ancient caravan routes of the Tafilalet.",
