    "sge_title": "Errachidia Desert Tours – The Shortest Road to the Sahara",
    "sge_intro": "Errachidia sits at the head of the Ziz Valley, about two hours’ drive from the dunes of Erg Chebbi. With its own airport, it is the closest city to Merzouga for travelers who fly in, and the easiest way to reach the Sahara without the long drive from Marrakech or Fes. With Morocco Adventures Tour, every trip from Errachidia is private, starts at your hotel or the airport and is guided by a team that lives in this region.",
    "sge_why_t": "Why start your desert trip in Errachidia?",
    "sge_why_p": "Flying to Errachidia turns a full day of driving into a short, scenic transfer along the Ziz Valley. You arrive in the dunes rested, and you can choose to continue to Marrakech or Fes afterwards.",
