    "sgt_title": "Tangier Tours – Where Europe Meets Morocco",
    "sgt_intro": "Tangier sits on the Strait of Gibraltar, where the Mediterranean meets the Atlantic and Africa looks across at Europe. Many travelers arrive here by ferry from Spain or by plane, which makes it the perfect first stop for a journey south: the blue lanes of Chefchaouen, Roman Volubilis, the medina of Fes, the dunes of the Sahara and, finally, Marrakech. With Morocco Adventures Tour, every trip from Tangier is private, planned around your arrival and guided by a local team.",
    "sgt_why_t": "Why start your trip in Tangier?",
    "sgt_why_p": "Tangier is the natural door to Morocco from Europe. Starting in the north lets you travel the whole country in one direction, from the Rif Mountains to the Sahara and on to Marrakech, without going back on your steps.",
