    "sgc_title": "Casablanca Tours – From the Atlantic to the Sahara",
    "sgc_intro": "Most international flights to Morocco land in Casablanca, which makes it the natural first stop of a journey through the country. From here the road leads north to Rabat and the blue streets of Chefchaouen, east to the medina of Fes and the dunes of Merzouga, and south to the kasbahs and Marrakech. With Morocco Adventures Tour, every trip from Casablanca is private, planned around your flights and guided by a local team from start to finish.",
    "sgc_why_t": "Why start your trip in Casablanca?",
    "sgc_why_p": "Casablanca is Morocco’s largest city and its main air gateway. Starting here lets you see the Hassan II Mosque on day one and then travel through the whole country without backtracking.",
