    "er2_t1": "2 Days Errachidia",
    "er2_t2": "to Merzouga Desert Tour",
    "er2_eyebrow": "Errachidia · Merzouga · Errachidia",
    "er2_dur": "2 days",
    "er2_dur2": "2 days",
    "er2_o1": "If you’re looking to explore the heart of Morocco’s Sahara Desert in just two days, this 2-day desert tour from Errachidia to Merzouga offers an unforgettable adventure. Perfect for those with limited time, this tour takes you from the oasis town of Errachidia to the iconic Merzouga desert, where you’ll experience the magic of the Sahara, camel trekking, and a night under the stars.",
    "er2_o2": "A desert tour from Errachidia typically covers the Merzouga Desert, home to the towering Erg Chebbi dunes.",
    "er2_h1": "Discover the stunning Ziz Valley and its lush palm groves",
    "er2_h2": "Enjoy a camel ride through the magnificent Erg Chebbi dunes",
    "er2_h3": "Experience an unforgettable night at a luxury desert camp",
    "er2_h4": "Explore Merzouga and the surrounding desert landscape",
    "er2_d1_t": "Errachidia to Merzouga – A Journey Through the Desert Landscape",
    "er2_d1": "Your desert adventure begins in Errachidia, where you’ll be greeted by your guide and driver. After a scenic drive through the Ziz Valley, famous for its palm groves and picturesque landscapes, you’ll make your way towards Merzouga, the gateway to the Sahara. Upon arrival, you’ll take a camel ride across the Erg Chebbi dunes, the tallest dunes in Morocco, and head towards your luxury desert camp. Watch the stunning desert sunset and enjoy an authentic Berber dinner under the stars.",
    "er2_d1_n": "Luxury desert camp",
    "er2_d2_t": "Merzouga Desert to Errachidia – Sunrise and Scenic Return",
    "er2_d2": "Wake up early to watch the sunrise over the Sahara Desert, a truly magical experience. Afterward, you’ll return to Merzouga by camel or 4×4, depending on your preference. From here, you’ll head back to Errachidia, passing through more stunning desert landscapes, desert towns and valleys, and arrive in the city by the evening, with drop-off in Errachidia.",
