    "fs3_t1": "3 Days Sahara Desert Tour",
    "fs3_t2": "from Fes",
    "fs3_eyebrow": "Private tour · round trip from Fes",
    "fs3_dur": "3 days · 2 nights",
    "fs3_dur2": "3 days",
    "fs3_o1": "A short but complete Sahara journey that starts and ends at your riad in Fes. In three days you cross the Middle Atlas, sleep among the dunes of Erg Chebbi and discover the gorges and kasbah valleys of the south-east.",
    "fs3_o2": "The road south passes Ifrane, the cedar forests of Azrou with their Barbary macaques and the long palm groves of the Ziz Valley. In Merzouga a camel takes you into the dunes for a night in a desert camp, with dinner and Berber music under the stars.",
    "fs3_o3": "After sunrise over the dunes, you visit Rissani, walk in the Todra Gorge and spend the night in the Dades Valley, before driving back north to Fes through the Middle Atlas.",
    "fs3_h1": "Ifrane, the Switzerland of Morocco",
    "fs3_h2": "Barbary macaques in the cedar forest",
    "fs3_h3": "Ziz Valley palm groves",
    "fs3_h4": "Camel trek & Erg Chebbi camp",
    "fs3_h5": "Rissani market & Todra Gorge",
    "fs3_h6": "A night in the Dades Valley",
    "fs3_d1_t": "Fes – Ifrane – Ziz Valley – Merzouga",
    "fs3_d1": "Leave Fes early and climb into the Middle Atlas. Stop in Ifrane, with its alpine houses and cool air, then meet the Barbary macaques in the cedar forest near Azrou. Continue south, stopping at viewpoints over the palm groves of the Ziz Valley. In Merzouga, ride a camel into the Erg Chebbi dunes to your camp for dinner, Berber music by the fire and a night under the stars.",
    "fs3_d1_n": "Desert camp in Erg Chebbi",
    "fs3_d2_t": "Merzouga – Rissani – Todra Gorge – Dades",
    "fs3_d2": "Wake early for sunrise over the dunes, then ride back to Merzouga for breakfast. Visit Rissani, an old caravan town with a busy market, and walk between the 300-metre walls of the Todra Gorge. Continue to the Dades Valley, with its kasbahs, green oases and red rock formations, for the night.",
    "fs3_d2_n": "Riad or guesthouse in the Dades Valley",
    "fs3_d3_t": "Dades – Errachidia – Midelt – Fes",
    "fs3_d3": "After breakfast, start the long, scenic drive back north through Tinghir and Errachidia, then over the Middle Atlas via Midelt, with photo stops along the way. Arrival at your riad or hotel in Fes in the late afternoon or early evening.",
    "fs3_i1": "Pick-up and drop-off at your riad or hotel in Fes",
