    "fs2_t1": "2 Days Desert Trip",
    "fs2_t2": "from Fes to Merzouga",
    "fs2_eyebrow": "Private tour · a quick escape to the dunes",
    "fs2_dur": "2 days · 1 night",
    "fs2_dur2": "2 days",
    "fs2_o1": "The shortest way to sleep in the Sahara when you are staying in Fes. In two days you cross the Middle Atlas, ride a camel into the golden dunes of Erg Chebbi at sunset and spend a night under the stars, before driving back to your riad.",
    "fs2_o2": "The road south is a journey in itself: the alpine town of Ifrane, the cedar forest of Azrou and its Barbary macaques, the mountain town of Midelt and the long palm groves of the Ziz Valley, until the first dunes appear on the horizon.",
    "fs2_o3": "A good choice if your time is short. Keep in mind that both days are long drives, around eight hours each way with stops.",
    "fs2_h1": "Ifrane, the Switzerland of Morocco",
    "fs2_h2": "Barbary macaques in the cedar forest",
    "fs2_h3": "Ziz Valley palm groves",
    "fs2_h4": "Sunset camel ride in Erg Chebbi",
    "fs2_h5": "Night in a desert camp",
    "fs2_h6": "Sunrise over the dunes",
    "fs2_d1_t": "Fes – Ifrane – Midelt – Ziz Valley – Merzouga",
    "fs2_d1": "Pick-up from your riad in the morning and drive into the Middle Atlas. Stop in Ifrane, a quiet, tidy town with an alpine feel, then look for Barbary macaques in the cedar forest near Azrou. After a break in Midelt, follow the Ziz Valley and its palm groves, with photo stops at the viewpoints, past Erfoud to Merzouga. In the late afternoon, ride a camel into the Erg Chebbi dunes to watch the sunset, then reach your camp for dinner and a night under the stars.",
    "fs2_d1_n": "Desert camp in Erg Chebbi",
    "fs2_d2_t": "Merzouga – Rissani – Erfoud – Midelt – Fes",
    "fs2_d2": "Wake early for sunrise over the dunes, then have breakfast at camp. Leave the desert by camel or 4×4 and drive through Rissani, with its old market, and Erfoud, known for its fossils. Head north again along the Ziz Valley, over the Middle Atlas via Midelt and Ifrane, and arrive back at your riad in Fes in the evening.",
    "fs2_i1": "Pick-up and drop-off at your riad or hotel in Fes",
