    "mz3_t1": "3 Days from Marrakech",
    "mz3_t2": "to the Merzouga Desert",
    "mz3_eyebrow": "Private desert tour",
    "mz3_dur": "3 days · 2 nights",
    "mz3_dur2": "3 days",
    "mz3_o1": "Three days, one unforgettable road: from Marrakech over the High Atlas to the golden dunes of Erg Chebbi, with kasbahs, canyons and a night in the Sahara along the way.",
    "mz3_o2": "You cross the Tizi n’Tichka pass at 2,260 m, explore the UNESCO ksar of Ait Ben Haddou — seen in films like Gladiator — and visit Ouarzazate before spending the night in the Dades Valley, the “valley of a thousand kasbahs”.",
    "mz3_o3": "On day two you walk through the Todra Gorge between 300-metre cliffs, then ride a camel into the dunes of Merzouga for sunset, dinner, Berber music around the fire and a night in a comfortable desert camp. Day three starts with sunrise over the sand before the drive back to Marrakech.",
    "mz3_h1": "Tizi n’Tichka pass",
    "mz3_h2": "Ait Ben Haddou & Ouarzazate",
    "mz3_h3": "Dades Valley",
    "mz3_h4": "Todra Gorge",
    "mz3_h5": "Camel trek in Erg Chebbi",
    "mz3_h6": "Sunrise over the dunes",
    "mz3_d1_t": "Marrakech – Ait Ben Haddou – Dades Valley",
    "mz3_d1": "An early start from Marrakech takes you into the High Atlas over the Tizi n’Tichka pass, with views of peaks, valleys and Berber villages. Explore the alleys of Ait Ben Haddou and climb to the top for the view, then visit Ouarzazate and its Taourirt kasbah. In the late afternoon you reach the Dades Valley, with its red cliffs and kasbahs, for a traditional dinner and the night.",
    "mz3_d1_n": "Hotel or riad in Dades Valley",
    "mz3_d2_t": "Dades – Todra Gorge – Merzouga",
    "mz3_d2": "After breakfast, walk along the river at the bottom of the Todra Gorge between cliffs up to 300 metres high. Drive on through Berber villages, Tinjdad and Erfoud, known for its fossil workshops. In Merzouga you ride a camel into the dunes of Erg Chebbi as the sun sets, then enjoy dinner, Berber music and a night in a comfortable desert camp.",
    "mz3_d2_n": "Desert camp in Merzouga",
    "mz3_d3_t": "Merzouga – Ouarzazate – Marrakech",
    "mz3_d3": "Wake up for the sunrise over the dunes and have breakfast at the camp, then return to Merzouga by camel or 4×4. The long road back crosses the south and the High Atlas, with stops for photos and breaks, and you arrive in Marrakech in the evening.",
    "mz3_i1": "Pick-up and drop-off at your accommodation in Marrakech",
    "mz3_i2": "Private air-conditioned vehicle, fuel included",
    "mz3_i3": "Professional English-speaking driver-guide",
    "mz3_i4": "1 night in a hotel or riad in Dades Valley",
    "mz3_i5": "1 night in a desert camp in Erg Chebbi",
    "mz3_i6": "Camel trek into the dunes",
    "mz3_i7": "2 breakfasts and 2 dinners",
