    "mk12_card": "12 Days From Marrakech",
    "mk12_card_h": "Marrakech · Todra · Erg Chebbi camp · Fes · Volubilis · Rabat · Casablanca",
    "mk12_t1": "12 Days from Marrakech",
    "mk12_t2": "Imperial Cities & Sahara",
    "mk12_eyebrow": "Private grand tour",
    "mk12_dur": "12 days · 11 nights",
    "mk12_dur2": "12 days",
    "mk12_o1": "Twelve days to see Morocco properly: the red city of Marrakech, the kasbahs of the south, the great dunes of the Sahara, the imperial cities of the north and the Atlantic capitals — at a relaxed pace, with time to stop and look.",
    "mk12_o2": "You start with two days in Marrakech, including a guided walk through the medina and a visit to the Majorelle Garden. Then the road crosses the High Atlas to Ait Ben Haddou and Ouarzazate, and continues through the Rose Valley and the Todra Gorges to Merzouga.",
    "mk12_o3": "In the Sahara you take your time: Gnawa music in Khamlia, a visit to a nomad family, and a camel trek into the Erg Chebbi dunes for a night in a desert camp, with sunset and sunrise over the sand.",
    "mk12_o4": "The second half takes you north through the Ziz Valley, Midelt and the cedar forests of Azrou to Fes, then on to Volubilis, Meknes, Rabat and Casablanca, before a final free day back in Marrakech.",
    "mk12_h1": "Marrakech medina & Majorelle",
    "mk12_h2": "Ait Ben Haddou & Todra Gorges",
    "mk12_h3": "Gnawa music in Khamlia",
    "mk12_h4": "Camel trek & desert camp",
    "mk12_h5": "Fes medina with a local guide",
    "mk12_h6": "Volubilis, Rabat & Casablanca",
    "mk12_d1_t": "Welcome to Marrakech",
    "mk12_d1": "We meet you at the airport and drive you to your hotel or riad. The rest of the day is yours to settle in and enjoy your first evening in the Red City.",
    "mk12_d1_n": "Hotel or riad in Marrakech",
    "mk12_d2_t": "Marrakech with a local guide",
    "mk12_d2": "A local guide meets you in the medina for a walking tour of the old town. After lunch in the heart of the medina, visit the Majorelle Garden before a free evening in Marrakech.",
    "mk12_d2_n": "Hotel or riad in Marrakech",
    "mk12_d3_t": "Marrakech – Ait Ben Haddou – Ouarzazate",
    "mk12_d3": "We cross the High Atlas over the Tizi n’Tichka pass to the kasbah of Ait Ben Haddou, then continue to Ouarzazate and its film studios. Night in Ouarzazate.",
    "mk12_d3_n": "Hotel in Ouarzazate",
    "mk12_d4_t": "Ouarzazate – Todra Gorges – Merzouga",
    "mk12_d4": "Drive through the Rose Valley and stop at the Todra Gorges to walk between the high rock walls. In the evening you reach Merzouga, at the foot of the Erg Chebbi dunes.",
    "mk12_d4_n": "Hotel in Merzouga",
    "mk12_d5_t": "Exploring the Merzouga area",
    "mk12_d5": "A day around the desert: visit the village of Khamlia to listen to Gnawa music, meet a nomad family, discover palm-fringed oases and the landscapes around Erg Chebbi.",
    "mk12_d5_n": "Hotel in Merzouga",
    "mk12_d6_t": "Camel trek & night in the desert",
    "mk12_d6": "In the afternoon you ride camels into the highest dunes of Morocco to reach the camp for sunset. Dinner is a traditional Moroccan meal, followed by Berber drums around the fire and a night under a sky full of stars.",
    "mk12_d6_n": "Desert camp in Erg Chebbi",
    "mk12_d7_t": "Merzouga – Rissani – Ziz Valley – Midelt",
    "mk12_d7": "Sunrise over the dunes and breakfast at the camp. We head north through the market town of Rissani, Erfoud, the palm groves of the Ziz Valley and Errachidia to Midelt.",
    "mk12_d7_n": "Hotel in Midelt",
    "mk12_d8_t": "Midelt – Azrou cedar forest – Fes",
    "mk12_d8": "Cross the Middle Atlas, stop in the cedar forest of Azrou to see the Barbary macaques, pass through Ifrane and arrive in Fes.",
    "mk12_d8_n": "Hotel or riad in Fes",
    "mk12_d9_t": "Fes with a local guide",
    "mk12_d9": "Explore the medieval medina of Fes with a local guide, including the tanneries and the ceramics workshops. Night in a traditional riad.",
    "mk12_d9_n": "Riad in Fes",
    "mk12_d10_t": "Fes – Volubilis – Meknes – Rabat",
    "mk12_d10": "Visit the Roman ruins of Volubilis, have lunch in the imperial city of Meknes, then continue to Rabat, the capital, for the night.",
    "mk12_d10_n": "Hotel in Rabat",
    "mk12_d11_t": "Rabat – Casablanca – Marrakech",
    "mk12_d11": "Discover the historic sites of Rabat, then drive along the Atlantic to Casablanca for lunch or a drink by the ocean, before the road back to Marrakech.",
    "mk12_d11_n": "Hotel or riad in Marrakech",
    "mk12_d12_t": "Free day & departure",
    "mk12_d12": "Time for last-minute shopping in the souks and packing, then we drive you to the airport for your flight home.",
    "mk12_i1": "Airport pick-up and drop-off in Marrakech",
