    "ab_sub": "We are a Moroccan team who grew up between the dunes, the mountains and the old kasbahs — and we love sharing them with the world.",
    "ab_scroll": "Our story",
    "ab_s_eyebrow": "Our story",
    "ab_s_title": "We don't sell Morocco. We share it.",
    "ab_s_lead": "Morocco Adventures Tour started with a simple idea: show travellers the Morocco we know — not from a brochure, but from the road.",
    "ab_s_p1": "Our guides and drivers are from the south. They know where the light is best on the dunes, which family will invite you for tea, and how to turn a long drive into a story you will tell for years.",
    "ab_s_p2": "Every trip is planned by us, driven by us and lived with you. No call centres, no crowded buses — just a small local team that cares about every detail.",
