    "authentic-tours_title": "Authentic Morocco Tours",
    "authentic-tours_p1": "Some places can only be found with someone who grew up there. Our authentic tours leave the busy routes behind and follow quiet desert tracks, nomad grazing lands and villages that rarely see visitors. This is the Morocco of silence — wide horizons, slow mornings and tea shared with families who still live from the land.",
    "authentic-tours_p2": "Because we work only with our own local team, we can take you deep into the calmest corners of the Sahara, safely and respectfully. These journeys are made for travellers who value peace, real encounters and time to simply look around.",
