    "fes-tours_title": "Best Selling Fes Desert Tours",
    "fes-tours_p1": "From the old medina of Fes to the dunes of Merzouga, Morocco Adventures Tour makes the long road south easy. Our Fes desert tours take you through the Middle Atlas, the cedar forests of Azrou where Barbary macaques live, and the palm-filled Ziz Valley before the first dunes appear on the horizon.",
    "fes-tours_p2": "Whether you stay in Merzouga or continue all the way to Marrakech, we manage the driving, the stops and the timing. Comfortable vehicles, experienced drivers and a clear, honest service — so the journey from Fes becomes part of the adventure, not just the way to get there.",
