    tours_p2: "Our desert tours from Marrakech cross the High Atlas, the kasbahs of the south and the deep gorges before reaching the golden dunes. We plan the roads, the stops and the timing, so you can simply sit back and enjoy the journey. Honest prices, a friendly local team and real care at every step.",
